# Master of Divinity

The Master of Divinity is offered to students who hold a secular Bachelor’s degree. This is GCUA’s most comprehensive seminary program, providing rigorous theological and ministerial training at the graduate level.

This degree carries the full weight of seminary-level scholarship and is designed for those called to vocational ministry, church planting, or advanced theological teaching.

The student who enrolls in our M.Div. program understands this is a 3 year commitment—with a new year’s enrollment due after each previous year is completed.

[✦ REQUIRES SECULAR BACHELOR'S DEGREE · 96 CREDIT HOURS](https://gcits.org/degree/#)
